# Faction / race visuals (do not drift)

Distinction is **avatar art style** + **constructed frame per race** — not color washes on the same frame.

Source: `src/ui/raceFrameConstructor.ts`, `src/game/factionVisual.ts`.

## RI — LOCKED

- Avatars: Victorian daguerreotype, warm sepia, torn cream plate
- Frame: ornate **gold glass** (`buildRaceFrame("ri")` → `glass_frame_border`)
- Hurt: `*_hurt.png` swap
- **Clothing (living troops, 1914 field) — not British scarlet**
  - Tunic: olive-khaki / protective green (`защитный`) гимнастёрка or officer китель, high stand collar, brass buttons
  - Shoulder boards: rectangular gold **погоны** with thin branch piping (red for infantry) — prestige is gold, not a red coat
  - Cap: matching olive **фуражка**, black leather visor, white-orange cockade
  - Trousers (when shown): dark navy with yellow lampasse, or matching khaki
  - Leather: dark brown harness / Sam Browne
  - Red is **piping only**, never the mundir
  - Guards (`гвардеец`): khaki or dark bottle-green under a cuirass; red = facings only
  - Junkers (`юнкер`): same field kit as the ref plate
  - Riflemen (`стрелок` / `егерь`): khaki gymnastyorka, фуражка, Mosin — not ushanka, not a medieval forest cloak
  - Clergy (послушник, иеромонах, черница, миссионер): Orthodox black/dark — not a mundir
  - Imperial Memory undead: rotting version of the **same khaki kit**, not redcoats
  - Never: British redcoat, crimson greatcoat, scarlet tabard, ice-blue
  - Ref: `docs/lore/refs/ri-uniform-field-1914.png`
  - Prompts: `RI_FIELD_KIT` in `src/game/portraits.ts`

## Ordo Lumen

- Avatars: occult ash / wet-plate bone-grey (generate to this note — do not fake with blue tint)
- Frame: **iron occult plaque** constructed in code (bevels, diamonds, rivets) — not RI glass retinted
- Never use ice-blue as Ordo identity

## Восставшие

- Frame: mourning / rotten border (`risen` constructor)
- Avatars: funerary / mildew plate (when art exists)

## Neutral

- Frame: simple brass tintype corners (`neutral` constructor)

## Folk / лубок

- Frame: beige lubok plate on black — `screen_frame_folk.png` (four corners only, no rails)
- Avatars: lubok plate (when art exists) — not RI daguerreotype, not ice-blue
- Screen chrome preview: switcher **Фолк** / key **5**
- **Faction map:** Казачество (`cossack`) → folk frame

## Thorn / терн

- Frame: gothic grimoire corners — skull/cross stay off the rails (`screen_frame_thorn.png`, four corner crops; never stretch the plate, no connecting rails)
- Avatars: bone-white etched plate (when art exists)
- Switcher **Терн** / key **6**
- Do not aggressively remap all four rims — side-only squeeze at most
- **Faction map:** Горцы (`highlander`) → thorn frame

## Модерн / северный модерн

- Frame: patinated bronze Art Nouveau 1914 — birch, rowan (`screen_frame_moderne.png`, four corners only, no rails)
- Avatars: bronze-green wet-plate (when art exists) — not gold glass, not ice-blue
- Switcher **Модерн** / key **7**

## Folio / фолио — SCREEN chrome only (not a faction)

- Frame: Baroque manuscript filigree — dark sepia ink on cream parchment, thin knotwork rails, flared acanthus corners (`folio_corner_*.png` + tiled `folio_rail_{h,v}.png`)
- Two constructor layouts: **Фолио** (full window) / **Фолио · панель** (left dossier + vertical divider)
- Switcher **Фолио** / key **8**, **Фолио · панель** / key **9**
- Not gold glass, not charcoal, not ice-blue

## Cold / frostbite — STATUS only

`setFrost` / `flashFrost` = cold attacks. Never faction chrome.

## Wiring

- Always `glassStyleForFaction(army.faction)` / `buildRaceFrame(race, …)`
- Drop-in PNG (preferred): `public/assets/ui/race_frame_{ri|ordo|risen|neutral|folk|thorn|moderne}.png` — 780×780, transparent center ~708×708; optional `_hero`
- Folio screen chrome: `folio_corner_{tl|tr|bl|br}.png` + `folio_rail_{h|v}.png`
- No PNG → procedural recipe in `raceFrameConstructor.ts`
- New race look → asset and/or recipe + this rule
